{"id":10523,"slug":"10523-auto-keyword-va-range-based-for-loop-trong-c-11-dung-nhu-the-nao","category":"C++","subcategory":"Modern C++ (11/14/17)","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"`auto` keyword và range-based for loop trong C++11 dùng như thế nào?","question_en":"How are the `auto` keyword and range-based for loop used in C++11?","answer_vi":"**`auto`:** yêu cầu compiler tự suy kiểu (type deduction) từ biểu thức khởi tạo.\n\n```cpp\nauto x = 42;          // int\nauto y = 3.14;        // double\n\n// Đặc biệt hữu ích với kiểu dài:\nstd::map<std::string, std::vector<int>> m;\nauto it = m.begin();  // thay vì: std::map<std::string, std::vector<int>>::iterator\n```\n\n**Range-based for (C++11):**\n\n```cpp\nstd::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3};\n\nfor (int x : v)        // copy\nfor (int& x : v)       // reference — có thể sửa\nfor (const int& x : v) // const ref — đọc không copy\nfor (auto& x : v)      // auto + ref — tốt nhất cho mọi kiểu\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** `auto& x` giữ reference; `auto x` luôn copy kể cả với reference source.","answer_en":"**`auto`:** asks the compiler to deduce the type from the initialization expression.\n\n```cpp\nauto x = 42;                // int\nauto y = 3.14;              // double\n\n// Especially useful for verbose types:\nstd::map<std::string, std::vector<int>> m;\nauto it = m.begin();  // instead of: std::map<std::string, std::vector<int>>::iterator\n```\n\n**Range-based for (C++11):**\n\n```cpp\nstd::vector<int> v = {1, 2, 3};\n\nfor (int x : v)         // copy\nfor (int& x : v)        // reference — can modify\nfor (const int& x : v)  // const ref — read-only, no copy\nfor (auto& x : v)       // auto + ref — best default for any type\n```\n\n**Note:** `auto&` preserves reference; plain `auto` always copies even from a reference source.","answer_html_vi":"<p><strong><code>auto</code>:</strong> yêu cầu compiler tự suy kiểu (type deduction) từ biểu thức khởi tạo.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"auto x = 42;          // int\nauto y = 3.14;        // double\n\n// Đặc biệt hữu ích với kiểu dài:\nstd::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;int&gt;&gt; m;\nauto it = m.begin();  // thay vì: std::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;int&gt;&gt;::iterator\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span> x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">42</span>;          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// int</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span> y = <span class=\"hljs-number\">3.14</span>;        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// double</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Đặc biệt hữu ích với kiểu dài:</span>\nstd::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&gt;&gt; m;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span> it = m.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">begin</span>();  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// thay vì: std::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;int&gt;&gt;::iterator</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Range-based for (C++11):</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"std::vector&lt;int&gt; v = {1, 2, 3};\n\nfor (int x : v)        // copy\nfor (int&amp; x : v)       // reference — có thể sửa\nfor (const int&amp; x : v) // const ref — đọc không copy\nfor (auto&amp; x : v)      // auto + ref — tốt nhất cho mọi kiểu\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">std::vector&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&gt; v = {<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x : v)        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// copy</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&amp; x : v)       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// reference — có thể sửa</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&amp; x : v) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// const ref — đọc không copy</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span>&amp; x : v)      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// auto + ref — tốt nhất cho mọi kiểu</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> <code>auto&amp; x</code> giữ reference; <code>auto x</code> luôn copy kể cả với reference source.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><strong><code>auto</code>:</strong> asks the compiler to deduce the type from the initialization expression.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"auto x = 42;                // int\nauto y = 3.14;              // double\n\n// Especially useful for verbose types:\nstd::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;int&gt;&gt; m;\nauto it = m.begin();  // instead of: std::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;int&gt;&gt;::iterator\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span> x = <span class=\"hljs-number\">42</span>;                <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// int</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span> y = <span class=\"hljs-number\">3.14</span>;              <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// double</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Especially useful for verbose types:</span>\nstd::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&gt;&gt; m;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span> it = m.<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">begin</span>();  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// instead of: std::map&lt;std::string, std::vector&lt;int&gt;&gt;::iterator</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Range-based for (C++11):</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">cpp</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"std::vector&lt;int&gt; v = {1, 2, 3};\n\nfor (int x : v)         // copy\nfor (int&amp; x : v)        // reference — can modify\nfor (const int&amp; x : v)  // const ref — read-only, no copy\nfor (auto&amp; x : v)       // auto + ref — best default for any type\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">std::vector&lt;<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&gt; v = {<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>};\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x : v)         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// copy</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&amp; x : v)        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// reference — can modify</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>&amp; x : v)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// const ref — read-only, no copy</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">auto</span>&amp; x : v)       <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// auto + ref — best default for any type</span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Note:</strong> <code>auto&amp;</code> preserves reference; plain <code>auto</code> always copies even from a reference source.</p>","references":[{"label":"cppreference — auto specifier","url":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/auto"},{"label":"cppreference — Range-based for loop","url":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/range-for"},{"label":"GeeksforGeeks — Range-based for loop in C++","url":"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/cpp/range-based-loop-c/"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/10521-lambda-expression-trong-c-11-la-gi-cu-phap-va-capture-clause-hoat-dong-the-nao","title":"Lambda expression trong C++11 là gì? Cú pháp và capture clause hoạt động thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10522-move-semantics-va-rvalue-reference-trong-c-11-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Move semantics và rvalue reference (`&&`) trong C++11 là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/10524-nullptr-trong-c-11-khac-null-va-0-the-nao","title":"`nullptr` trong C++11 khác `NULL` và `0` thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10500-c-khac-c-o-nhung-diem-nao-quan-trong-nhat","title":"C++ khác C ở những điểm nào quan trọng nhất?"},{"url":"/q/10501-tham-chieu-trong-c-la-gi-khac-con-tro-the-nao","title":"Tham chiếu (`&`) trong C++ là gì? Khác con trỏ thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10502-new-va-malloc-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"`new` và `malloc` khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10503-stack-va-heap-trong-c-khac-nhau-the-nao","title":"Stack và Heap trong C++ khác nhau thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/10504-inline-function-la-gi-khi-nao-nen-dung","title":"Inline function là gì? Khi nào nên dùng?"}]}